{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787354424762980001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"scattered-bleakish-millipede","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"3eaf162be315de74436ffda4afc4250509f833efe5c7c59c6c0be525af28d591","event_uuid":"822cd6a5-4412-49ed-86d7-0d09a28a2d93","position":{"commit_sha":"9f3c0ab7e1bbafadf088c5d7a0a43265124eb108","position":"1787352218099985001-822cd6a5-4412-49ed-86d7-0d09a28a2d93"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"5a616defec6fc692feaf4f31b765b8e62dc7dbad48d6e7fc54c6ad8ae8cb280d","event_uuid":"1caf4398-3f0e-496d-9acd-2f064e8c8efa","position":{"commit_sha":"4da536dda7feb1cf5607479d8209ff1bb075ac48","position":"1787352228479919001-1caf4398-3f0e-496d-9acd-2f064e8c8efa"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787352218099985001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThree near-identical walkers discover a ticket's replacement link (iterate `deps` for `duplicates`, then `find_inbound_relationships` for `supersedes`): `src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py:58-108` (`_has_live_replacement_link`), `close_precheck.py:111-151` (`_recorded_replacement_target`), `src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py:76-118` (`find_replacement`), wrapped again by `src/rebar/_commands/gates.py:166`. They differ only in liveness check and return type. Bug `frolicky-dependable-peccary` came from `verdict()` consulting only `find_replacement` while the \"not_a_bug needs no link\" rule lived in a comment in `_ensure_duplicate_close_is_linked` (`close_precheck.py:169-174`); the `DISPOSITION_CLASSES == _NON_COMPLETION_BUG_CLASSES` equality is held only by a test (`close_disposition.py:43`).\n\n## Approach\nOne `close_disposition.replacement_of(ticket_id, tracker, *, require_live: bool) -> str | None`; `_has_live_replacement_link` and `_recorded_replacement_target` become one-line wrappers kept as monkeypatch seams (the 738a tests patch the boolean). `_NON_COMPLETION_BUG_CLASSES` imports `DISPOSITION_CLASSES` so the equality is structural. Guard: the `duplicates`/`supersedes` walk (`find_inbound_relationships(` combined with `\"supersedes\"`) appears only in `close_disposition.py`.\n\n## Scope\n`src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py`, `src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py`, `src/rebar/_commands/gates.py`, `src/rebar/_commands/txn.py`, `tests/unit/commands/test_close_disposition.py`.\n\n## Testing\nHappy path: a duplicate with a live target closes; edge: a duplicate whose target is itself closed-as-duplicate is refused; not_a_bug needs no link. Pinning: `tests/unit/test_close_disposition_attestation_738a.py`, `tests/unit/test_close_gate_disposition_69b9.py`, `tests/unit/test_close_precheck_duplicate_link_c8fd.py`, `tests/unit/commands/test_close_disposition.py` pass unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] One walker body remains; checked by the guard test and `grep -c \"supersedes\" src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py` equal to 0.\n- [ ] Pinning suites pass with no assertion edits; checked by `pytest` and `git diff --stat`.\n- [ ] `_NON_COMPLETION_BUG_CLASSES` is defined as an import of `DISPOSITION_CLASSES`; checked by reading `txn.py`.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/gates.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/txn.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"tests/unit/commands/test_close_disposition.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["consolidation","janitor","fortnight-review"],"ticket_id":"111a-4626-8d2c-42bf","ticket_type":"story","title":"One replacement-link walker for close disposition","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["822cd6a5-4412-49ed-86d7-0d09a28a2d93","1caf4398-3f0e-496d-9acd-2f064e8c8efa"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787354424762980001,"uuid":"04e9c5bc-5c52-4acc-a878-6f43566fff5d"}